WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV v3.0 — eco-synthesis (45s) Narrator Joy

1
00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:07.768
First, generating text from scratch for already-solved problems wastes electricity and invites avoidable mistakes.

2
00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:16.266
Second, an energy-ordered cascade checks microjoule lookup tables and exact verifiers first, waking large models last.

3
00:00:16.706 --> 00:00:24.693
Third, every accepted answer passes deterministic checks and crystallizes downward into a fast, reusable lookup skill.

4
00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:30.455
Nobody convenes a committee of professors every afternoon to debate six times seven.

5
00:00:30.455 --> 00:00:38.564
Smart synthesis checks proven lookup tables in microseconds, wakes large models only on new puzzles, and saves verified winners.

6
00:00:39.004 --> 00:00:43.509
Streaming specialist model slices only on misses and gating every

7
00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:48.707
patch with automated tests turns costly generation into lasting competence.
